+ * signal is the unread COUNT in a small mint pill at the ring's corner, "9+"
+ * past nine so it never outgrows the corner — not a dot.
+ *
+ * 2026-09-28 (LUX-LIST-64 #11, #52): a BARE bell — no round background, no
